#: main.cpp:27
msgid "KDE's application finder"
msgstr "KDE se aanwendings vinder"

#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Install .desktop files into directory <dir>"
msgstr "Installeer .werkskerm lêers binne-in gids <dir>"

#: main.cpp:36 toplevel.cpp:50
msgid "KAppfinder"
msgstr "Kappfinder"

#: toplevel.cpp:53
msgid ""
"The application finder looks for non-KDE applications on your system and "
"adds them to the KDE menu system. Click 'Scan' to begin, select the desired "
"applications and then click 'Apply'."
msgstr ""
"Die aanwendings soeker soek na nie-KDE aaanwendings in u stelsel en "
"voeghulle by die Kde kieslys stelsel. Kliek 'Scan' om te begin, kies die "
"verlangde aanwendings en dan druk op 'Apply'."

#: toplevel.cpp:63
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Aanwending"

#: toplevel.cpp:64
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrywing"

#: toplevel.cpp:65
msgid "Command"
msgstr "Opdrag"

#: toplevel.cpp:76
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Opsomming:"

#: toplevel.cpp:80
msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Skandeer"

#: toplevel.cpp:85
msgid "Unselect All"
msgstr "Afkeur Alle"

#: toplevel.cpp:245
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Summary: found %n application\n"
"Summary: found %n applications"
msgstr ""
"Opsomming: gevind %n aanwending\n"
"Opsomming: gevind %n aanwendings"

#: toplevel.cpp:288
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: %n application was added to the KDE menu system.\n"
"%n applications were added to the KDE menu system."
msgstr ""
"'n Aanwending was bygevoeg na die Kde kieslys stelsel.\n"
"%n Aanwendings was bygevoeg na die Kde kieslys stelsel."

